#{[17592186475612 #edb/ref 1080 "{\\int }_{0}^{2}{\\int }_{y-4}^{-y}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y+{\\int }_{2}^{4}{\\int }_{-y}^{y-4}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475612 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475612 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "75dc7848-feaf-5ac4-b992-3cb45e8de29d" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475625 #edb/ref 1080 "2(e-{e}^{-1})" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475625 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475625 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "7da24e9f-953b-5b8d-9fb3-433072fccab1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475637 #edb/ref 1080 "e-{e}^{-1}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475637 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475637 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "830d9a09-4b3d-5488-ab8b-7407c02fb4fe" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475652 #edb/ref 1080 "{\\int }_{-1}^{2}{\\int }_{1-x}^{\\sqrt{3-x}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{2}^{3}{\\int }_{-\\sqrt{3-x}}^{\\sqrt{3-x}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475652 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475652 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "8b2918b4-5b1a-5e09-96c3-37123de1ba55" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475654 #edb/ref 1080 "{\\int }_{-1}^{2}{\\int }_{1-x}^{\\sqrt{3-{x}^{2}}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{-1}^{3}{\\int }_{-\\sqrt{3-x}}^{\\sqrt{3-x}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475654 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475654 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "8c2300f0-baa5-5212-b5f7-d261c57b46a7" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475655 #edb/ref 1080 "{\\int }_{-2}^{-1}{\\int }_{0}^{3x/2+6}f(x,y)\\,dy\\,dx+{\\int }_{-1}^{0}{\\int }_{0}^{-3x-3}f(x,y)\\,dy\\,dx" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475655 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475655 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "8d5774ae-41bf-5890-9a15-9b50552548d3" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475690 #edb/ref 1080 "{\\int }_{0}^{2}{\\int }_{{x}^{2}}^{x+12}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{2}^{4}{\\int }_{{x}^{2}}^{x+12}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475690 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475690 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "a8c31b71-e03d-55bb-ad32-043d29658c47" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475697 #edb/ref 1080 "{\\int }_{0}^{2}{\\int }_{{x}^{2}}^{7x}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{2}^{4}{\\int }_{{x}^{2}}^{x+12}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475697 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475697 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "acfce3f4-00a0-50c8-a775-d7fb78414a0e" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475719 #edb/ref 1080 "{\\int }_{-2}^{-1}{\\int }_{0}^{3x/2+6}f(x,y)\\,dy\\,dx+{\\int }_{-1}^{0}{\\int }_{-3x-3}^{0}f(x,y)\\,dy\\,dx" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475719 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475719 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "b67a2061-2ce8-5628-bc8b-fc965822fa6f" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475729 #edb/ref 1080 "{\\int }_{0}^{2}{\\int }_{y+4}^{-y}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y+{\\int }_{2}^{4}{\\int }_{-y}^{y+4}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475729 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475729 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "bbd2d108-8ee6-5f0f-bf18-681b33bcd677" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475734 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{e}{2}-{e}^{-1}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475734 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475734 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "bf4fcd37-0cd2-54cf-8269-3de8bbb9ae1f" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475740 #edb/ref 1080 "{\\int }_{-4}^{-2}{\\int }_{3x/2+6}^{0}f(x,y)\\,dy\\,dx+{\\int }_{-2}^{-1}{\\int }_{0}^{-3x-3}f(x,y)\\,dy\\,dx" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475740 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475740 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "c549c79d-1614-52e0-816d-7b47adc5ec4c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475757 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{e-{e}^{-1}}{2}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475757 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475757 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "d10e18e2-81c4-5858-b24a-9e24eac04a78" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475774 #edb/ref 1080 "{\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{y/2}^{\\sqrt{2y}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y+{\\int }_{1}^{2}{\\int }_{(3y-2)/2}^{\\sqrt{2y}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475774 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475774 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "db123738-960e-56c7-b973-f03c45f9e841" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475781 #edb/ref 1080 "{\\int }_{-1}^{2}{\\int }_{1-x}^{\\sqrt{3-{x}^{2}}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{2}^{3}{\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{3-x}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475781 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475781 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "ddf08033-d820-539a-8135-8cad5b26ce10" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475788 #edb/ref 1080 "{\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{y}^{\\sqrt{2y}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{1}^{2}{\\int }_{(3y-2)/2}^{\\sqrt{2y}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475788 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475788 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "e161cf4c-90cd-5345-a9b9-1dfc2d9a1476" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475793 #edb/ref 1080 "{\\int }_{0}^{2}{\\int }_{-y}^{y-4}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y+{\\int }_{2}^{4}{\\int }_{-y}^{y-4}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475793 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475793 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "e47d7134-16ad-5275-ae8c-f2d10be54f29" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475800 #edb/ref 1080 "{\\int }_{-1}^{3}{\\int }_{1-x}^{\\sqrt{3-x}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{2}^{3}{\\int }_{x-3}^{3-x}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475800 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475800 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "e9e13229-a93d-5417-8009-b20a01b65756" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475808 #edb/ref 1080 "{\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{{y}^{2}/2}^{2y}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y+{\\int }_{1}^{2}{\\int }_{(2y+2)/3}^{\\sqrt{2y}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475808 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475808 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "ee55bf76-b835-59b2-b361-2dd5c58bebd6" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475809 #edb/ref 1080 "{\\int }_{0}^{2}{\\int }_{{x}^{2}}^{7x}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{2}^{4}{\\int }_{{x}^{2}}^{7x}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475809 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475809 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "eed3c083-742f-5564-b657-509747487ec1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475853 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186475465 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475853 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186475555 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475853 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186475655 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475853 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186475719 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475853 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186475740 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475853 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475853 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475853 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186475465 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475853 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "467e7482-236e-50bd-9069-2e1ac24cf7f7" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475858 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186475494 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475858 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186475652 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475858 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186475654 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475858 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186475781 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475858 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186475800 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475858 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475858 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475858 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186475652 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475858 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "54e9c707-1747-52ad-abb8-366afb9bc3dd" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475866 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186475600 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475866 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186475606 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475866 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186475612 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475866 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186475729 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475866 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186475793 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475866 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475866 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475866 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186475612 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475866 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "7086a944-de0d-51cd-aea2-90dc23497170" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475892 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186475522 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475892 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186475567 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475892 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186475774 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475892 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186475788 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475892 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186475808 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475892 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475892 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475892 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186475774 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475892 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "d14fe408-e710-5a6c-9dc2-c17893127e06" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475920 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186475858 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475920 #edb/ref 1069 "q-82075" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475920 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475920 #edb/ref 1071 "Consider the finite region $D$ in the $xy$-plane enclosed by the curve $x=3-{y}^{2}$ and the line $y=1-x.$ \nExpress ${∬}_{D}f(x,y)\\,dA$ as a sum of repeated integrals over type I regions." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475920 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "1f526958-5ff7-5f1e-b97a-1125f849ae32" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475920 #edb/ref 1074 "First, let's sketch our region.\n\n![](images/8a/8a46756cd4842caf7977ef72ae05912a635843a06382b21136362455a94369e4.png)\n\nThe region $D$ can be partitioned into two type I regions ${D}_{1}$ and ${D}_{2},$ as shown below.   Notice that we're using that $x=3-{y}^{2}$ can be split into $y=\\pm \\sqrt{3-x}.$ \n\n![](images/43/43da7a61d7a4bff15274cdacbf1f3265c097edb8740583c69463460467f8100f.png)\n\nAs a result, we get\n\n$$\n{D}_{1}=\\{(x,y)\\,:\\,-1\\le x\\le 2,\\,1-x\\le y\\le \\sqrt{3-x}\\}\n$$\n\nand \n\n$$\n{D}_{2}=\\{(x,y)\\,:\\,2\\le x\\le 3,\\,-\\sqrt{3-x}\\le y\\le \\sqrt{3-x}\\}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, using the additivity property of double integrals, we obtain \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{D}f(x,y)\\,dA & ={∬}_{{D}_{1}}f(x,y)\\,dA+{∬}_{{D}_{2}}f(x,y)\\,dA \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-1}^{2}{\\int }_{1-x}^{\\sqrt{3-x}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{2}^{3}{\\int }_{-\\sqrt{3-x}}^{\\sqrt{3-x}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475923 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186475853 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475923 #edb/ref 1069 "q-132296" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475923 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475923 #edb/ref 1071 "Consider the finite region $D$ in the $xy$-plane enclosed by the lines $y=\\frac{3x}{2}+6,$ $y=-3x-3$ and $y=0.$ Express ${∬}_{D}f(x,y)\\,dA$ as a sum of repeated integrals over type I regions." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475923 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "266a83b4-e89e-5341-ae78-39b530317ac4" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475923 #edb/ref 1074 "First, let's sketch our region.\n\n![](images/8d/8dad5cdaa9fdcaf0293773c53a0b5ab58d7d98aea0099af0a9ba616e72759129.png)\n\nThe region $D$ can be partitioned into two type I regions ${D}_{1}$ and ${D}_{2},$ as shown below.\n\n![](images/a0/a0b5bfe05214df5f59a563677bd6b4f7dfd85be4d8e27fd4d7b31f87a679cd2b.png)\n\nAs a result, we get\n\n$$\n{D}_{1}=\\{(x,y)\\,:\\,-4\\le x\\le -2,\\,0\\le y\\le \\frac{3x}{2}+6\\}\n$$\n\nand \n\n$$\n{D}_{2}=\\{(x,y)\\,:\\,-2\\le x\\le -1,\\,0\\le y\\le -3x-3\\}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, using the additivity property of double integrals, we obtain \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{D}f(x,y)\\,dA & ={∬}_{{D}_{1}}f(x,y)\\,dA+{∬}_{{D}_{2}}f(x,y)\\,dA \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-4}^{-2}{\\int }_{0}^{3x/2+6}f(x,y)\\,dy\\,dx+{\\int }_{-2}^{-1}{\\int }_{0}^{-3x-3}f(x,y)\\,dy\\,dx.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475948 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186475866 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475948 #edb/ref 1069 "q-132380" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475948 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475948 #edb/ref 1071 "![](images/48/4826bc628c1bd8f4293fd5fbf90bf9155658c15336c2c9e86a5e7678dfcf1ca3.png)\n\nConsider the finite region $D$ in the $xy$-plane enclosed by the lines $y=-x,$ $y=x+4,$ $y=0$ and $y=4,$ as shown in the picture. Express the double integral of the function $f(x,y)$ over the region $D$ as a sum of repeated integrals over type II regions." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475948 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "94516772-c0e6-5471-a227-05c6f1da1b17" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475948 #edb/ref 1074 "First, let's write our equations in terms of $y,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y=-x & \\,⟹\\,x=-y \\\\ y=x+4 & \\,⟹\\,x=y-4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe region $D$ can be partitioned into two type II regions ${D}_{1}$ and ${D}_{2},$ as shown below.\n\n![](images/17/17d3ceabf3cd7a052398d8d12b7963c5ca64356605554e3ff43c21c7321e45de.png)\n\n  \n\nAs a result, we get\n\n$$\n{D}_{1}=\\{(x,y)\\,:\\,0\\le y\\le 2,\\,y-4\\le x\\le -y\\}\n$$\n\nand \n\n$$\n{D}_{2}=\\{(x,y)\\,:\\,2\\le y\\le 4,\\,-y\\le x\\le y-4\\}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, using the additivity property of double integrals, we obtain \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{D}f(x,y)\\,dA & ={∬}_{{D}_{1}}f(x,y)\\,dA+{∬}_{{D}_{2}}f(x,y)\\,dA \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}{\\int }_{y-4}^{-y}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y+{\\int }_{2}^{4}{\\int }_{-y}^{y-4}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475969 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186475892 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475969 #edb/ref 1069 "q-82116" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475969 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475969 #edb/ref 1071 "![](images/7f/7fa5e4cd0c573ab5841e3ded221486ee2cabf6e00e1493c3de06fe4d9a87e3a7.png)\n\nConsider the finite region $D$ in the $xy$-plane enclosed by the lines $y=\\frac{1}{2}{x}^{2},$ $y=2x,$ and $y=\\frac{(2x+2)}{3},$ as shown in the picture. Express the double integral of the function $f(x,y)$ over the region $D$ as a sum of repeated integrals over type II regions." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475969 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "d88f3d27-3ac2-554c-ada9-11e1bf695d44" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186475969 #edb/ref 1074 "First, let's write our equations in terms of $y,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y=\\frac{1}{2}{x}^{2} & \\,⟹\\,x=\\sqrt{2y} \\\\ y=2x & \\,⟹\\,x=\\frac{y}{2} \\\\ y=\\frac{2x+2}{3} & \\,⟹\\,x=\\frac{3y-2}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe region $D$ can be partitioned into two type II regions ${D}_{1}$ and ${D}_{2},$ as shown below.\n\n![](images/63/63848a26cff0641ac83c73e809028852697212ce64a8cb954815d514922721a1.png)\n\n  \n\nAs a result, we get\n\n$$\n{D}_{1}=\\{(x,y)\\,:\\,0\\le y\\le 1,\\,\\frac{y}{2}\\le x\\le \\sqrt{2y}\\}\n$$\n\nand \n\n$$\n{D}_{2}=\\{(x,y)\\,:\\,1\\le y\\le 2,\\,\\frac{3y-2}{2}\\le x\\le \\sqrt{2y}\\}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, using the additivity property of double integrals, we obtain \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{D}f(x,y)\\,dA & ={∬}_{{D}_{1}}f(x,y)\\,dA+{∬}_{{D}_{2}}f(x,y)\\,dA \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{y/2}^{\\sqrt{2y}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y+{\\int }_{1}^{2}{\\int }_{(3y-2)/2}^{\\sqrt{2y}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
